  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Excursions. Enter Richard and Clifford."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "richard",
        "name": "RICHARD",
        "displayName": "Richard"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Now, Clifford, I have singled thee alone.",
          "plainText": "Now Clifford I have singled thee alone",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Suppose this arm is for the Duke of York,",
          "plainText": "Suppose this arm is for the Duke of York",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "And this for Rutland; both bound to revenge,",
          "plainText": "And this for Rutland both bound to revenge",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Wert thou environed with a brazen wall.",
          "plainText": "Wert thou environed with a brazen wall",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "clifford",
        "name": "CLIFFORD",
        "displayName": "Clifford"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Now, Richard, I am with thee here alone.",
          "plainText": "Now Richard I am with thee here alone",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "This is the hand that stabbed thy father York,",
          "plainText": "This is the hand that stabbed thy father York",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "And this the hand that slew thy brother Rutland;",
          "plainText": "And this the hand that slew thy brother Rutland",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "And here's the heart that triumphs in their death",
          "plainText": "And here's the heart that triumphs in their death",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "And cheers these hands that slew thy sire and brother",
          "plainText": "And cheers these hands that slew thy sire and brother",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "To execute the like upon thyself;",
          "plainText": "To execute the like upon thyself",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "And so have at thee!",
          "plainText": "And so have at thee",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They fight. Warwick comes; Clifford flies."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "richard",
        "name": "RICHARD",
        "displayName": "Richard"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, Warwick, single out some other chase;",
          "plainText": "Nay Warwick single out some other chase",
          "lineType": "verse"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "For I myself will hunt this wolf to death.",
          "plainText": "For I myself will hunt this wolf to death",
          "lineType": "verse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-third-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth-2-4-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}